      "severity": "actionable-hardening",
      "summary": "inactiveOptionalDependencies is matched only against package.dependencies (one unconditional optional normal decl) plus feature-walk not-enabled. It is not required to appear on node.deps. Policy can therefore name unused optionals that cargo did not put on the resolve node (toml serde_core under parse; winnow memchr with simd off). Require the omitted rustc edge name to exist on that node's deps so the exception tracks the weak-feature metadata quirk only. Not shown to hide an active identity compile edge on this graph."
